# Single source of truth for launchd automation agents.
# Format (pipe-delimited):
#   name|description|friendly_alias
# - name:               canonical agent name (matches launchd/com.user.<name>.plist)
# - description:        human-readable summary shown in list/install output
# - friendly_alias:     short name accepted by setup-automation.sh (optional)
# Profiles alone select jobs. An empty selection enables none.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

dotfiles-backup|Local plaintext rollback snapshots|backup
dotfiles-doctor|Daily health monitoring|doctor
update-audit|Weekly Nix, Homebrew, and macOS update report|updates
repo-update|Repository updates|
log-cleanup|Weekly log rotation|
brew-audit|Weekly Brewfile drift detection|
weekly-digest|Weekly automation health digest|
lmstudio-server|LM Studio local server|lmstudio
spicetify-reapply|Re-apply spicetify on Spotify updates|
